    "explanation": "Decision for both parties. On the record this is a genuine rider no-show: the SGD 4.50 cancellation fee stands and the driver is paid SGD 3.60.\n\nThe rider's case. You say the driver cancelled almost immediately and before the free waiting period elapsed, pointing to the platform wait timer, which started at 20:36:59 and stopped at the 20:39:58 termination, 179 seconds. That reading is rejected. POL-NS-01(c) measures the dwell from the first qualifying in-geofence GPS fix, not from the driver's 'I'm Here' tap and not from the wait timer. The GPS trace EV-GPS-02718 places the driver inside the 50 m STANDARD pickup geofence continuously from 20:36:57 to 20:39:58, a dwell of 181 seconds against the 180-second free waiting period in force (EV-TRIP-02718, platform_policy.free_wait_sec = 180); the record's own derived shortfall is -1.0 s, a surplus. Your POL-NS-06 shortfall claim therefore fails and nothing is refundable on that ground. Your further point that you were not at the pickup point is correct - your device sat 874 to 881 m from the pin throughout (41 fixes, all 0.0 kph) - but it does not help you, because POL-NS-04 requires a locating message from you and the only chat message (20:37:17) was the driver's. POL-NS-03 does not apply: the driver's stationary fixes were inside the arrival radius, not outside it within 400 m.\n\nThe driver's case. All four POL-NS-01 limbs hold: (a) the trip record carries an 'arrived' event at 20:36:57; (b) the trace puts you in the geofence at that same moment; (c) the dwell of 181 s meets the 180 s minimum; (d) the trip was terminated by you at 20:39:58 under RIDER_NO_SHOW, after the dwell elapsed. Your marker is not false under POL-NS-05: at 20:36:57 you were in the geofence at 0.0 kph, neither more than 300 m out nor moving at 15 kph or above. The fare breakdown EV-FARE-02718 charges exactly SGD 4.50, matching the fee in force, so there is no POL-NS-08(d) fare defect.\n\nMoney. The SGD 4.50 charge stands (as to the fee, POL-GEN-03 NO_ACTION means the present state is left in place and the rider's claim is not supported), and POL-NS-07 fixes your payout at 80% of the SGD 4.50 net fee = SGD 3.60, the residual SGD 0.90 being retained as the platform service fee. The anti-farming bar does not apply (EV-DPROF-02718: no_show_terminations_30d is 0, below the 4-or-more limb), so compensation is paid rather than withheld.\n\nEvidence, weight and escalation. Every artifact carrying a deciding fact - EV-GPS-02718, EV-TRIP-02718, EV-FARE-02718, EV-DPROF-02718 - is at weight 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0 and confidence is not impaired. The MISSING traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-02718-01 (weight 0.0) carries no deciding fact: it bears only on POL-NS-06(i), which cannot run in any event because there is no shortfall and only one in-geofence interval. Two side-claims that cited it without naming its MISSING_ARTIFACT issue code were discarded by the referee for undisclosed impairment. No POL-NS-09 ground applies: confidence is above the 0.70 floor, POL-NS-01(c) fixes which clock governs so the wait-timer and GPS readings are not an unresolved contradiction, neither party shows cross-party disputes in the trailing 90 days, and the anti-farming check does not trip. The monetary effect, SGD 3.60, is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so it executes on issue."
  },
