arrival referral arises under POL-NS-05(ii).\n\nOther routes considered. POL-NS-03 does not apply - the driver's stationary fixes lie inside the arrival radius, not outside it but within 400 m - so no wrong-entrance refund and no pin-ambiguity goodwill is payable. POL-NS-04 does not exonerate the rider: she sent no locating or coordinating message (the only chat message is the driver's, at 20:37:17), and her own track places her 875-881 m from the pin, outside the 100 m rider-presence radius, so limb (c) is affirmatively failed on admissible fixes and the clause does not apply in any event. POL-NS-10 does not apply because the rider did not cancel; the cancellation grace limb concerns a rider's own cancellation.\n\nMoney and confidence. The fare_breakdown charges exactly SGD 4.50, which reconciles with platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd of 4.50, so there is no POL-NS-08(d) defect. The POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 0 (below the 4-or-more limb) and 0/62 completed trips is 0.0 (not above 0.08), so compensation is paid rather than withheld. It is 80 percent of the SGD 4.50 net fee, i.e. SGD 3.60. The case does not escalate: rider_profile.no_show_disputes_30d is 1 (below 3), both parties' disputes_with_counterparty_90d are 0, no admissible artifacts contradict each other, no deciding artifact is impaired, and confidence is above the 0.70 floor. On this ruling the rider's SGD 4.50 charge stands, amount_sgd carries the same SGD 3.60 figure as driver_compensation_sgd per POL-GEN-03, and the monetary effect (SGD 3.60) is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so it executes automatically.\n\nEvidence weight. The facts above are carried by EV-GPS-02718 and EV-TRIP-02718, each at weight_multiplier 1.0, and by EV-FARE-02718 and EV-DPROF-02718 at 1.0; the cap on confidence is therefore 1.0. EV-ADVIS-02718-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 and carries no fact; it is not needed, and two claims advanced on it were discarded for not disclosing its MISSING_ARTIFACT impairment."
